   d) present the Software or any part of it as your own work, including in
      academic, coursework, thesis or competition submissions (right of
      authorship, Article 1265 of the Civil Code);
   e) remove or alter the author and copyright notices or the text of this
      license.

3. You may:
   a) view the source code on GitHub;
   b) fork the repository within GitHub to the extent provided by the GitHub
      Terms of Service. A fork grants no rights beyond those listed in this
      section;
   c) quote small excerpts for informational, scientific or educational
      purposes with attribution and a link to the repository, within the
